<title>UK: BT Q2 operating costs up 7.4 pct - a breakdown.</title>
<headline>BT Q2 operating costs up 7.4 pct - a breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a breakdown of British Telecommunications Plc's quarterly operating costs, which rose 7.4 percent in the second quarter against the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>					    Q2 96/7	Q2 95/6    change</p>
<p>					   mln stg	mln stg	  %</p>
<p> Staff costs			     929	    916	   +1.4</p>
<p> Own work capitalised		  (95)	  (105)	  -9.5</p>
<p> Net staff costs			 834	    811	   +2.8</p>
<p> Depreciation			    563	    533	   +5.6</p>
<p> Payments to telecoms operators    376	    338	  +11.2</p>
<p> Other operating costs	     1,016	     984	  +3.3</p>
<p> Other operating income	     (17)	    (16)	  +6.3</p>
<p> Operating costs pre redundancy  2,772	   2,650	  +4.6</p>
<p> Total redundancy costs		183	     101	 +81.2</p>
<p> TOTAL OPERATING COSTS	     2,955	   2,751	  +7.5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 9787</p>
